#: ../../faq.md:1
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../faq.md:3
msgid "按症状归类的排查表。先做这三件事，多数问题能自己定位："
msgstr ""
"Symptom-first troubleshooting tables. Do these three things first — most "
"problems identify themselves:"

#: ../../faq.md:5
msgid "`GET /api/v2/health`：返回 503 就是数据库不通（DSN 写错、库没起、账号无权限）。"
msgstr ""
"`GET /api/v2/health`: a 503 means the database is unreachable (bad DSN, "
"database not running, no permission for the account)."

#: ../../faq.md:6
msgid "看响应头 / 响应体里的 `request_id`，在服务端日志里搜同一个值，能拿到完整堆栈。"
msgstr ""
"Take the `request_id` from the response headers or body and search the "
"server logs for it; that gives you the full stack trace."

#: ../../faq.md:7
msgid "后台 `/admin/setting` 里的开关与上限，往往就是「为什么不行」的答案。"
msgstr ""
"The switches and limits under `/admin/setting` in the admin are often the"
" answer to why something is refused."

#: ../../faq.md:9
msgid "部署与启动"
msgstr "Deployment and startup"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "现象"
msgstr "Symptom"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "原因与处理"
msgstr "Cause and fix"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "启动报 `STORAGE_DIR must be an absolute path`"
msgstr "Startup fails with `STORAGE_DIR must be an absolute path`"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "配置里写了相对路径，改成绝对路径（容器内是 `/app/server/data/upload`）"
msgstr ""
"The config holds a relative path; use an absolute one (inside the "
"container that is `/app/server/data/upload`)"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "`/api/v2/health` 返回 503"
msgstr "`/api/v2/health` returns 503"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "数据库连不上：核对 `sapic_db_url`、库是否启动、账号权限与库名"
msgstr ""
"The database is unreachable: check `sapic_db_url`, whether the database "
"is running, and the account permissions and database name"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "前端刷新页面 404"
msgstr "Refreshing a page returns 404"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "nginx 缺 SPA 回退：`try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html`"
msgstr "nginx is missing the SPA fallback: `try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html`"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "图片直链、邮件里的链接是内网地址"
msgstr "Image direct links and links in emails point at an internal address"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "没设 `sapic_external_base_url`，反代/网关后面必须设成对外地址"
msgstr ""
"`sapic_external_base_url` is not set; behind a reverse proxy or gateway "
"it must be the public address"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "静态资源 404 / 拿到旧页面"
msgstr "Static assets 404, or you get the old page"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "`index.html` 被长缓存了；应 `Cache-Control: no-store`，只有 `/assets/` 可以长缓存"
msgstr ""
"`index.html` is cached for too long: it must be `Cache-Control: no-"
"store`, only `/assets/` may be cached long"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "容器重建后数据没了"
msgstr "Data is gone after recreating the container"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "没挂 `/app/server/data`；库文件、上传文件与钩子包都在这里"
msgstr ""
"`/app/server/data` is not mounted; the database, uploads and hook "
"packages all live there"

#: ../../faq.md:20
msgid "登录与会话"
msgstr "Login and sessions"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "登录成功但刷新就掉线"
msgstr "Login succeeds but the session is lost on refresh"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "反代没传 `X-Forwarded-Proto` 或没开 `sapic_proxyfix=1`，Cookie 的 `Secure` 与站点协议不一致"
msgstr ""
"The reverse proxy does not pass `X-Forwarded-Proto`, or "
"`sapic_proxyfix=1` is off: the cookie `Secure` flag no longer matches the"
" site scheme"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "OIDC 回调 400 `invalid oidc state`"
msgstr "OIDC callback returns 400 `invalid oidc state`"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "回调域名/协议与发起时不一致：检查 `sapic_proxyfix`、外层 TLS 透传与 OIDC 侧登记的回调地址"
msgstr ""
"The callback domain or scheme differs from the one used to start the "
"flow: check `sapic_proxyfix`, TLS passthrough on the outer layer and the "
"callback URL registered on the OIDC side"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "登录提示账号未激活"
msgstr "Login says the account is not active"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid ""
"`status=1` 与待审核（`-1`）能登录；已拒绝 / 已禁用不行，管理员在 `/admin/users` "
"处理。待审核账号可正常浏览，只是不能上传图片"
msgstr "`status=1` and pending (`-1`) accounts can sign in; rejected / disabled "
"ones cannot, and an administrator handles them under `/admin/users`. A "
"pending account can browse normally, it just cannot upload images"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "关闭密码登录后进不去了"
msgstr "Locked out after turning off password login"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "`password_login` 关掉前要先把管理员账号绑定 OIDC；已锁死则直接改库里的站点设置"
msgstr ""
"Bind the administrator account to OIDC before disabling `password_login`;"
" if you are already locked out, edit the site settings in the database "
"directly"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "`invalid csrf token`"
msgstr "`invalid csrf token`"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "拿浏览器会话当令牌用了；客户端一律用 PAT"
msgstr "A browser session was used as a token; clients always use a PAT"

#: ../../faq.md:30
msgid "上传"
msgstr "Upload"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "413 / `file exceeds N MB`"
msgstr "413 / `file exceeds N MB`"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid ""
"三层取最小值：nginx `client_max_body_size`、`sapic_maxupload`、站点 "
"`upload_image_max_size` / `upload_video_max_size`，改大时一起改"
msgstr ""
"Three layers take the minimum: nginx `client_max_body_size`, "
"`sapic_maxupload` and the site `upload_image_max_size` / "
"`upload_video_max_size` — raise them together"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "`file type is not allowed`"
msgstr "`file type is not allowed`"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "后台「上传后缀白名单」`upload_allowed_ext` 没放开该后缀；视频还要开 `allow_video`"
msgstr ""
"The upload extension allowlist `upload_allowed_ext` does not include that"
" extension; video also needs `allow_video`"

#: ../../faq.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`{\"code\":\"FORBIDDEN\",\"message\":\"anonymous upload is disabled\"}`"
msgstr "`{\"code\":\"FORBIDDEN\",\"message\":\"anonymous upload is disabled\"}`"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "请求没带令牌，或站点关闭了匿名上传"
msgstr "The request has no token, or the site has anonymous uploads disabled"

#: ../../faq.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`{\"code\":\"UNAUTHORIZED\",\"message\":\"invalid token\"}`"
msgstr "`{\"code\":\"UNAUTHORIZED\",\"message\":\"invalid token\"}`"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "令牌填错、已撤销或已过期，重新建一枚"
msgstr "The token is wrong, revoked or expired; create a new one"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "`token scope does not allow upload`"
msgstr "`token scope does not allow upload`"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "令牌没勾「上传图片」"
msgstr "The token does not have the upload scope"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "客户端报「找不到图片地址」"
msgstr "The client says it cannot find the image URL"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "JSON 路径填错：v2 信封是 `data.image.src`，不是 `src`"
msgstr "The JSON path is wrong: the v2 envelope has `data.image.src`, not `src`"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "URL 上传报 `remote fetch failed`"
msgstr "URL upload reports `remote fetch failed`"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "服务端抓取只接受域名（IP 字面量直接拒）、不跟随重定向；内网地址会被拦，管理员才可用站点代理兜底"
msgstr ""
"Server-side fetching accepts domains only (IP literals are rejected) and "
"does not follow redirects; private addresses are blocked, and only "
"administrators can fall back to the site proxy"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "上传成功但状态码不是 200"
msgstr "The upload succeeded but the response status is not 200"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "上传成功返回 **201**；有的客户端把 201 当失败，按 `code: \"OK\"` 判断"
msgstr ""
"A successful upload returns **201**; some clients treat 201 as a failure "
"— check `code: \"OK\"` instead"

#: ../../faq.md:43
msgid "图片访问"
msgstr "Image access"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "访问 `/raw/xxx` 返回 404"
msgstr "`/raw/xxx` returns 404"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "图片已删除/已过期，或副本已不在对应后端（查 `image_backends.state`）"
msgstr ""
"The image was deleted or expired, or the replica is no longer on that "
"backend (check `image_backends.state`)"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "上传成功但链接打不开"
msgstr "The upload succeeded but the link does not open"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "图片在私有相册或私有读的后端：需登录后经 `/raw/<sha>` 访问，直链不对外"
msgstr ""
"The image is in a private album or on a private-read backend: it needs a "
"login and is served through `/raw/<sha>`, never as a direct link"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "自己站点能看、别人引用时 403"
msgstr "It works on your own site but third-party embeds get 403"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "该图开了 Referer 校验；把引用方域名加进「允许引用的域名」，或关掉该开关"
msgstr ""
"Referrer checking is enabled for that image; add the embedding domain to "
"the allowed referrers, or turn the switch off"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "管理员在图库里看不到别人的公开图"
msgstr "Administrators cannot see other users public images in the library"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "个人图库只含自己的与共享的；看全站要显式切「全站」视图（`scope=all`，只有公开图）"
msgstr ""
"The personal library only contains your own and shared images; switch to "
"the site-wide view explicitly (`scope=all`, public images only)"

#: ../../faq.md:52
msgid "后台与扩展"
msgstr "Admin and extensions"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "后台看不到钩子"
msgstr "A hook does not show up in the admin"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid ""
"模块没被登记或 import 失败：`HOOK_PKG_STORAGE_DIR` 只加入 "
"`sys.path`、**不扫描目录**，要在钩子页登记模块名；导入异常看日志里的 traceback"
msgstr ""
"The module is not registered, or the import failed: "
"`HOOK_PKG_STORAGE_DIR` is only added to `sys.path` and is **never "
"scanned**, so register the module name on the hooks page; look for the "
"traceback in the logs"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "后台安装扩展报 `HOOK_PKG_STORAGE_DIR is not configured`"
msgstr "Installing an extension reports `HOOK_PKG_STORAGE_DIR is not configured`"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "该项被置空，填回目录（默认 `server/data/hooks`）并确保运行用户可写"
msgstr ""
"The option is empty; point it back at a directory (default "
"`server/data/hooks`) and make sure the runtime user can write there"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "改了钩子代码没生效"
msgstr "Hook code changes have no effect"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "调一次重载（`POST /api/v2/hooks/reload` 或钩子页的「重载」），不用重启进程"
msgstr ""
"Trigger a reload (`POST /api/v2/hooks/reload` or the reload button on the"
" hooks page); no process restart needed"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "钩子市场列表加载失败"
msgstr "The hook market listing fails to load"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "出网被拦或 GitHub 不可达；用 `sapic_hookmarketurl` 指向镜像，或在市场页「手动安装」直接填包名"
msgstr ""
"Outbound traffic is blocked or GitHub is unreachable; point "
"`sapic_hookmarketurl` at a mirror, or use manual install and type the "
"package name"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "后台看不到「可更新」"
msgstr "No update badge in the admin"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "`sapic_updatecheckurl` 被置空（纯内网部署），或上游接口不可达"
msgstr ""
"`sapic_updatecheckurl` is empty (internal-only deployment), or the "
"upstream feed is unreachable"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "管理员接口一律 404"
msgstr "Every admin endpoint returns 404"

#: ../../faq.md
msgid "用的是普通账号；后台路由对非管理员渲染 404，不提示无权限"
msgstr ""
"You are signed in as a normal account; admin routes render 404 for non-"
"administrators instead of saying forbidden"

#: ../../faq.md:63
msgid ""
"写钩子时遇到的具体问题（插槽不出现、按钮没反应、配置存不上）见 "
"[钩子基础契约](extend/contract.md)；本页只管「服务本身不对劲」。"
msgstr ""
"Hook-specific problems (a slot does not render, a button does nothing, "
"config will not save) are in [Hook basics](extend/contract.md); this page"
" is about the service itself misbehaving."

